<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#EDEFDA; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><br></div><div><table cellpadding="0" width="500" cellspacing="0" id="topTable" height="450" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><tbody><tr valign="top"><td styleinsert="1" height="300" style="background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="50"><td teditid="c1r1" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0" id="c1r1" style="font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><div><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br></span></div><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Dear Customer,</span></td></tr><tr valign="top" height="300"><td teditid="c1r2" aeditid="c1r2" locked="0" id="c1r2" style="font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Welcome to Monster.com, the world's largest online career site.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">We thank you for joining the world's largest online career site. I am&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">________</strong><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">&nbsp;from the Client Relations Team who will be handling all your customer service related queries.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">For security reasons, we have sent the login details in a separate auto-generated mailer, which you must have received by now. Please log on to&nbsp;</span><a href="https://recruiter.monster.com.hk/" target="_blank" style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">https://recruiter.monster.com.hk/</a><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">&nbsp;for HK services and enter your login details to access Monster Recruiter account.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Your contract covers the following products / services.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="7" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-left: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-bottom-width: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td width="27%" bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);"><strong>Products/Service</strong></td><td width="26%" bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);"><strong>Country/Website</strong></td><td width="16%" bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);"><strong>Quantity</strong></td><td width="17%" bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);"><strong>Validity</strong></td><td width="14%" bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);"><strong>Amount</strong></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td><td bgcolor="#edefda" style="font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">If you have any queries related to product / service description, please do let us know within 7 days of receipt of this mail.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">You can contact me anytime between 9 am to 6 pm HKT for any queries.</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Note: &nbsp;Please change your password after you login to the account for the first time and do not share your account details with anybody to ensure the security of your account.</strong><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Regards,</span><br style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">SIGNATURE</strong></td></tr><tr valign="top" height="50"><td teditid="c1r3" aeditid="c1r3" locked="1" id="c1r3" style="border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Escalation of any Customer Service matter</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">In the unlikely event of your query or complaint not being resolved promptly to your satisfaction, please write a mail to&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:Rajender.Yadav@monsterindia.com" title="mailto:Rajender.Yadav@monsterindia.com" style="font-size: 13px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Rajender.Yadav@monsterindia.com</a><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">&nbsp;as a first level of escalation and to&nbsp;</span><span style="line-height: 22px;"><a href="mailto:CRHEAD-SEA@Monster.com" style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">CRHEAD-SEA@monsterindia.com</a><font color="#999999">&nbsp;for second level escalation.&nbsp; The matter will be directly investigated by the senior management of our Customer Service team.</font><font face="Calibri, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153);"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><br></span></font></span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Terms of Use</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We thank you for using Monster. For uninterrupted access to our services, it is important for you to read and understand our&nbsp;</span><a href="http://www.monster.com.hk/terms_of_use.html" title="http://www.monsterindia.com/terms_of_use.html" style="font-size: 13px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Terms of Use</a><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">. For your convenience, we are emphasizing on some of the Prohibited Uses of Monster listed and we look forward to your cooperation in adhering to the same.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Mass mailing/Spamming/Non-career related mailing is strictly prohibited</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We are committed to preventing any form of misuse of our jobseeker database. If any user indulges in:</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Mass-mailing messages about job openings without having adequately narrowed the list of jobseekers to whom it is being sent</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">OR spamming</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">OR sending any mail with contents that are not strictly jobs/careers oriented</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Monster at its own discretion may deactivate the userÆs account in any such case, without further notice.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Posting or refreshing the same job multiple times</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We have noticed some users have been posting several jobs and refreshing them at an unusual frequency. Monster Terms of Use strictly prohibit such use of our job posting facility and if any user continues to refresh multiple jobs periodically, we may choose to deactivate the account.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Posting jobs with external links</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We do not permit any external links to other websites from any of our job postings, unless the same has been explicitly approved by Monster.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Posting jobs that are discriminatory</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We do not permit posting of jobs that specifically restrict applications from jobseekers based on religion, caste, gender etc. Any such postings may be deleted without notice and account deactivated.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Posting jobs that seek payments from jobseekers</strong><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">We do not permit any posting which requires an upfront or periodic payment from jobseekers.</span><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><br style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;"><strong style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">Mass download of resumes<br></strong><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; line-height: 22px;">If any user downloads resumes at an unusual pace or by using any software or spider programs, the account will be instantly deactivated.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>